    "title": "Auto-derive task dependencies from spec depends_on relationships",
    "type": "task",
    "description": "Spec-level depends_on field with derive integration - Add --depends-on flag to kspec item set for spec items. When deriving tasks, automatically create task dependencies based on spec dependencies. Example: if @spec-A depends_on @spec-B, then kspec derive @spec-A creates task-A depending on task-B. Removes need to manually set task dependencies after derive.",
