      {
        "_ulid": "01KGVGSH49350X0MVF442ZVV10",
        "created_at": "2026-02-07T07:41:49.577Z",
        "author": "@claude",
        "content": "Implementation: Two parts. (1) Add --depends-on flag to item set (may overlap with 01KGTVH6 relationship flags task). (2) In derive handler, when creating a task from a spec that has depends_on, look up existing tasks with matching spec_ref for each dependency. If found, add to new task's depends_on. Design decisions needed: if dependency spec has no task yet, warn (don't block). Skip transitive deps — only direct. No circular detection needed if specs are acyclic (validate could check). Addresses #1 post-import friction from MEMORY.md.",
